scope\">6.16</span> </span>. (Cf. Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">aio, ad-agium</b>: <span class=\"gk\">ἦ</span> fr. <span class=\"gk\">Ἦκτ</span>, hence <span class=\"gk\">ἠμί</span> etc. on analogy of <span class=\"gk\">φῆ</span>: <span class=\"gk\">φημί</span>, etc.)</div></div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἡμι</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἡμι-</span>, insep. Prefix, used in compos., <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">half-.</b> (Cf. Skt. <b class=\"lex-tr\">sāmi-</b>, Lat. <b class=\"lex-tr\">sēmi-.</b>)</div></div>"}